host_about:
Meghan: I am a 40 something working mother of two kids. I am married to an amazing school teacher. I enjoy the occasional full night of sleep, music, gardening, black coffee, local ice cream, Yazoo Sly Rye Porter, and Scrabble - sometimes in that order. My weekend to-do list usually starts and ends with vacuuming. I also prioritize spending time with friends, neighbors, and other interesting people. 

Greg: 
Bike commuting, bike community, racing, coaching, etc;
Coffee! (roasting, brewing, and drinking);
Education, community service, fatherhood, teaching;
Music, mandolin.

We both worked in the the hospitality and service industries in our past lives and we are enthusiastic about being able to provide a fantastic place for people to stay and experience Nashville. We love this city. We also love to travel.

Owner and Operators of Trendy and Tipsy Inc. a boutique and online clothing brand that provides all the latest fashion at affordable prices as well as a edgy and sustainable one-of-a-kind repurposed vintage line.

@shoptrendyandtipsy
@staytrendyandtipsy

Curating a brand new, and of course Trendy, Penthouse Experience in the heart of Downtown Nashville. 
*Available December 2021
